A clockwork rejuvenator is a small clockwork device that can bring a person back from death. It works once, and then it is spent.

The [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin/Damien|forge-heart]] made the one the Weft carry, spending the last of its divine energy on it. [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawnmonger]] has worked out how the device is built, so more can be made in time.
